      "html": "<ul><li>Scientific name: Hypostomus gymnorhynchus (Norman, 1926)</li><li>Synonym: Plecostomus gymnorhynchus</li><li>Type locality: Iponcin Creek, into Approuague R., French Guiana.</li><li>IUCN Red List: Not Evaluated</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "key": "distribution",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1292",
      "html": "<p>South America: Guianan coastal drainages, from the Oyapock westward to the Maroni basin. Recorded from the coastal rivers of French Guiana (Oyapock, Mana and Approuague) and Suriname (Marowijne).</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "reproduction",
