      "html": "<p>Unreported. There is no breeding report.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "notes",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1292",
      "html": "<p>Etymology: Greek, hypo = under + Greek, stoma = mouth. The specific epithet refers to its bare (gymnos = bare, nude) snout (rhynkus = snout, nose).</p>"
